text = "in the year 2069 scientist tried to create a source of clean, affordable and sustainable drinking water for the world. While their plan worked on a small scale in the lab something went wrong when they tried to implement it on a large scale, instead of getting rid of bacteria it made the bacteria grow to almost human proportions. This caused a global water crisis nearly wiping out the human race until a group of brave wariors decided to try and fight the bacteria. They succeeded in clearing the bacteria and creating a small colony with safe water for people to live in




The bacteria only never got fully defeated so now 11 years later everytime the water gets too dirty someone from the colony gets picked to descend down the well and defeat the bacteria, so far the water has always gotten cleaner yet none of the wariors have ever returned..."
